# WinUI build outputs: wwwroot is a copy of the built web app (~7.8k files) and
# AppPackages are MSIX builds. Unignored, Tailwind v4's auto source scan crawls
# them and the dev server's index.css never finishes compiling.
windows-native/Plajah.WinUI/wwwroot/
windows-native/Plajah.WinUI/AppPackages*/
# Code-signing key + cert — never commit.
